    {
      "id": "41ADEA405950CD9F",
      "title": "&f&lAssassin&r",
      "description": [
        "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
        "&fUnderstand the Assassin playstyle and its tradeoffs.",
        "",
        "&fMore movement and critical chance; lower maximum health. These are the subclass’s starting tradeoffs and direction, not your character’s final stat totals.",
        "",
        "&6&l◇ HOW TO&r",
        "&61. &fCompare the subclass root with your other two options.",
        "&62. &fInspect its three paths: Silent Step · Killer Instinct · Deathblow.",
        "&63. &fChoose and invest in the personal skilltree when you are ready.",
        "",
        "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
        "&fAvoid committing to a long attack while your escape route is blocked.",
        "",
        "&7Reading check · Mark this when you understand the guide.",
        "",
        "&7Optional branch · Supports your journey alongside the main campaign."
