      "title": "&f&lTry the playstyle&r",
      "description": [
        "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
        "&fComplete the project described below.",
        "",
        "&fUse the training yard to test short attack windows, disengagement and stamina or cooldown recovery.",
        "",
        "&6&l◇ HOW TO&r",
        "&61. &fEquip suitable gear you already have.",
        "&62. &fPractice in the town training yard.",
        "&63. &fWrite down one strength and one weakness you noticed.",
        "",
        "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
        "&fThe activity check records your practice. It does not require you to spend points or commit to this class.",
